  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transition phase for Property Tax (PROTAX) - Transition Phase of Property Tax (PROTAX)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Transition phase for Property Tax (PROTAX)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Bidraget syftar till att st&#xf6;dja den albanska regeringen i genomf&#xf6;randet av fastighetsskattereformen. Syftet med Fastighetsskattereformen &#xe4;r att etablera samf&#xf6;rvaltning mellan kommuner och det centraliserade generaldirektoratet f&#xf6;r fastighetsskatt. Detta kommer att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra den &#xf6;vergripande effektiviteten genom att utnyttja stordriftsf&#xf6;rdelar samt automatisering genom teknik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution aims to support the Albanian Government in the implementation of the Property Tax Reform. The aim of Property Tax Reform is to establish co-administration between municipalities and the centralized General Directorate of Property Tax. This will improve the overall efficiency by exploiting economies of scale as well as automation by technology.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the Project is to ensure full-scale implementation of building taxation using the Fiscal Cadastre in 2026. By the end of 2025, the following outcomes are expected:
&#x2022;Legal frameworks are in place to facilitate building taxation with the FC in 2026 and preparations for subsequent reform stages.
&#x2022;Technical frameworks are ready for building taxation with FC in all municipalities.
&#x2022;The main target groups are ready for building taxation with FC in 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
